38853>>>>>>>    Procedure SetActionButtons
38856>>>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38856>>>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38856>>>>>>>        Boolean bHasRecord
38856>>>>>>>        Handle hoDD
38856>>>>>>>
38856>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoDD
38857>>>>>>>        Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
38858>>>>>>>        Get HasRecord of hoDD to bHasRecord
38859>>>>>>>
